---
import Layout from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Non-Damage Boxing for Youth and Gyms · Thee Rainers"
  description="Full offense and defense with minimum unnecessary head trauma. A structured framework for parents, coaches, and gym owners who want safer boxing without removing the craft.">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 pt-32 pb-16 md:pb-24 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
    <div class="max-w-[720px]">
      <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">Thee Rainers · For Parents, Coaches, and Gyms</p>
      <h1 class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.84] mb-8"
        style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.5vw, 4.5rem);">
        Non-damage<br/>boxing.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/65 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-[560px]">
        Full offense and defense. Minimum unnecessary head trauma. The complete sport, trained with structure and clear limits on contact that causes harm.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/40 text-xs leading-relaxed mt-5 max-w-[480px]">
        Boxing carries inherent risk. This framework aims to reduce unnecessary head contact, not eliminate risk. We recommend medical evaluation after any suspected concussion and clearance before returning to sparring.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE PROBLEM FOR THIS AUDIENCE -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">The gap</p>
      <h2 class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.86] mb-6"
        style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);">
        The methods exist.<br/>Most gyms don't use them.
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 border-t border-[#0A0A0A]/8 pt-10">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#0A0A0A]/12 pl-5 py-1">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">Chaotic sparring</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Free rounds before the mechanics are built. Beginners absorbing contact they are not equipped to reduce. The damage accumulates before the skill does.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#0A0A0A]/12 pl-5 py-1">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">No framework to stand behind</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Coaches know something is off. They lack a clear methodology to hand to parents or defend to a board. Instinct is not enough when the conversation is about brain health.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#0A0A0A]/12 pl-5 py-1">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">Defense treated as optional</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Offense gets the attention. Guard discipline, movement logic, and composure under pressure come later, if at all. They are not optional. They are what limits damage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WITNESS SECTION -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 py-14 md:py-20 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
    <div class="max-w-[860px] mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">What it looks like in practice</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10">
        <div>
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-base mb-4 leading-tight">
            This is not a theoretical concern.
          </p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/55 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Gyms in Italy, Lithuania, Latvia. Hundreds of sparring sessions across different countries and cultures. The pre-fight clearance in some facilities is five seconds of checking your eyes. If a fighter is knocked out, someone provides assistance. No protocol follows. No guidance. No regulatory response. Fighters get back in without a timeline or a conversation.
          </p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The research describes one version of the sport. What happens inside most gyms is another. This framework exists because those two things need to close.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO THIS IS FOR -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 py-16 md:py-20 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
    <div class="max-w-[860px] mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">Who this serves</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-[#F7F6F4]">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">Parents</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your child wants to box. You want to know that the environment is structured, the contact is limited, and there is a coach who can explain why.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-[#F7F6F4]">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">Coaches</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">You already care about safety. You need a clear methodology and the language to communicate it to parents and gym leadership, not just instinct.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-[#F7F6F4]">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">Gym owners</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">You want to offer youth programs without the liability of chaotic sparring. A structured, defensible framework that protects your athletes and your program.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GYM OWNER SEED -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 py-10 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
    <div class="max-w-[860px] mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/40 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-[520px]">Building a structured youth program at your gym? If this work is relevant to what you are doing, get in touch.</p>
      <a href="mailto:rainers@theerainers.com?subject=Gym%20Program"
        class="shrink-0 text-[#0A0A0A]/40 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase hover:text-[#0A0A0A]/70 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap">Email Us →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EARLY ACCESS CAPTURE -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 py-16 md:py-20 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
    <div class="max-w-[560px] mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-5">Early access</p>
      <h2 class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.88] mb-4"
        style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);">
        Be first when<br/>resources open.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
        This framework has practical application for parents, coaches, and gym programs. Leave your name and email. We will reach out when resources open.
      </p>

      <div id="safe-wrap">
        <form id="safe-form" class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <input
            type="text"
            id="safe-name"
            required
            placeholder="Your name"
            autocomplete="name"
            class="w-full border border-[#0A0A0A]/15 bg-[#F7F6F4] px-5 py-4 text-[#0A0A0A] text-sm focus:border-[var(--blue)] focus:bg-white focus:outline-none transition-colors duration-200 placeholder:text-[#0A0A0A]/30"
          />
          <input
            type="email"
            id="safe-email"
            required
            placeholder="your@email.com"
            autocomplete="email"
            class="w-full border border-[#0A0A0A]/15 bg-[#F7F6F4] px-5 py-4 text-[#0A0A0A] text-sm focus:border-[var(--blue)] focus:bg-white focus:outline-none transition-colors duration-200 placeholder:text-[#0A0A0A]/30"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            id="safe-submit"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-[var(--blue)] focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#0A0A0A] focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
          >
            Get Early Access · Free →
          </button>
        </form>
        <p id="safe-success" class="hidden text-[#0A0A0A] text-sm font-bold tracking-wide mt-5">You are on the list. We will reach out when the resources and consultations open.</p>
        <p id="safe-error" class="hidden text-[var(--red)] text-sm mt-3">Something went wrong. Try again or email rainers@theerainers.com</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-[#0A0A0A]/30 mt-4">No spam. Unsubscribe any time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<script>
  function wireSafeForm(): void {
    const form = document.getElementById('safe-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
    if (!form || form.dataset.bound === 'true') return;
    form.dataset.bound = 'true';

    const nameEl  = document.getElementById('safe-name')    as HTMLInputElement | null;
    const emailEl = document.getElementById('safe-email')   as HTMLInputElement | null;
    const submit  = document.getElementById('safe-submit')  as HTMLButtonElement | null;
    const success = document.getElementById('safe-success') as HTMLElement;
    const error   = document.getElementById('safe-error')   as HTMLElement;

    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const email     = emailEl?.value.trim() ?? '';
      const full_name = nameEl?.value.trim()  ?? '';
      if (!email || !full_name) return;

      if (submit) { submit.disabled = true; submit.textContent = 'One moment...'; }
      error.classList.add('hidden');

      try {
        await fetch('/api/lead-capture', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ email, full_name, source: 'safe-boxing' }),
        });
      } catch {
        // non-blocking — show success regardless
      }

      (window as Window & { trackEvent?: (n: string, d: Record<string, unknown>) => void }).trackEvent?.('generate_lead', {
        lead_source: 'safe-boxing',
        currency: 'USD',
        value: 0,
      });

      form.classList.add('hidden');
      success.classList.remove('hidden');
    });
  }

  wireSafeForm();
</script>
